# AI config

`.cursor/rules/` and `.cursor/skills/` are the **single source of truth**.

`.agents/`, `.claude/`, root `AGENTS.md`, and root `CLAUDE.md` are **generated**. Edit them in `.cursor/` then run:

```bash
pnpm sync-ai-rules
```

Drift check (CI / before merge):

```bash
pnpm check-ai-rules
```

Do not hand-edit `.agents/skills/`, `.agents/rules/`, `.claude/**`, or the generated index files. The next sync overwrites them.

Skill: `ai-config-sync`. Algorithm: `.cursor/skills/ai-config-sync/references/sync-algorithm.md`.
